</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Blessed is the man whose heart, to</l><l>Zion, is an open way;</l><l>He’s the one whose strength is in Thee;</l><l>He will praise Thee all the day.</l><l>In communion with the churches,</l><l>Trusting Thee, Thy praise he sings;</l><l>Passing through the weeping valley,</l><l>It becomes a place of springs.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>One day spent among Thy churches,</l><l>Better than a thousand is!</l><l>Even to the lowest member,</l><l>Sun and shield Jehovah is.</l><l>Grace and glory, every good thing,</l><l>On us now He doth outpour;</l><l>Blessed is that man who dwelleth</l><l>In the churches evermore.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
